'''Glacial Artifact''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessories|Accessory]] that grants the [[player]] {{Stat|+15 mining wisdom}} on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. It is the upgraded form of the {{Item|Glacial Ring}} and is the final Accessory in the "Glacial" line.

