'''Glacial Artifact''' can be salvaged for {{Item|Ice Essence|amount=15}}.

== Tips ==
*It is generally not recommended to salvage this item, as it gives the same amount of {{Item|Ice Essence}} as the {{Item|Glacial Talisman}}.

